Action Items:

ACTION:  Ira to query OP Japan mailing list about OPVP filter:
(a) Is the OPVP filter still used by Japanese manufacturers?
(b) If yes, would OP Japan maintainers be willing to modify OPVP filter to
remove dependencies on non-standard Poppler APIs?
(c) Otherwise, should OP add a Google Summer of Code 2017 project to update
OPVP?
- OPEN - in progress - Ira sent query to Printing Japan mailing list
- dialog w/ Suzuki-san (OP Japan, Hiroshima) during November/December
- Suzuki-san has concerns about the size of Ghostscript solution for OPVP

ACTION:  Till and Ira to start email discussion of OP projects for GSoC 2017
in December, due to early project submission deadline of 9 February 2017
- OPEN

ACTION:  Till and Ira draft new content for Open Printing website that
explains SNAPS approach to distribution-independent drivers
- OPEN - in progress - Till is working on SNAPS packages
http://snapcraft.io/


